  "title_zh": "10月制造业PMI是49.3%，比9月低0.8个百分点",
  "title_en": "October manufacturing PMI is 49.3%, 0.8 percentage points lower than September",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月31日，国家统计局公布了10月的制造业采购经理指数，简称PMI。这个数字是49.3%，比9月下降了0.8个百分点。",
      "en": "On October 31, the National Bureau of Statistics released the manufacturing Purchasing Managers' Index (PMI) for October. The figure was 49.3%, down 0.8 percentage points from September."
    },
    {
      "zh": "PMI是一种经济数据，用来看企业的生产和采购情况。50%是分界线：高于50%表示经济在扩大，低于50%表示在收缩。",
      "en": "PMI is a type of economic data used to look at companies' production and purchasing. 50% is the dividing line: above 50% means the economy is expanding, and below 50% means it is contracting."
    },
    {
      "zh": "非制造业商务活动指数是49.7%，比上个月低0.5个百分点。综合PMI产出指数同样是49.7%，不过它比上个月低了1.0个百分点。",
      "en": "The non-manufacturing business activity index was 49.7%, down 0.5 percentage points from the previous month. The composite PMI output index was also 49.7%, down 1.0 percentage point from the previous month."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在价格方面，购进价格指数是56.8%，比上月低4个百分点。出厂价格指数是51.7%，比上月低2.3个百分点。",
      "en": "On prices, the purchase price index was 56.8%, 4 percentage points lower than the previous month. The ex-factory price index was 51.7%, 2.3 percentage points lower than the previous month."
    }
  ],
